tps://www.bjxch.gov.cn/rwxc/xxxq/pnidpv954519.html"}], "borrowed": {"zh": "桥体与“银锭观山”视廊合为一个参观点；能否观山受天气和能见度影响。\n现有来源重在景观视廊和游览线路，未说明桥体建造年代、结构尺寸、保护级别或独立开放规则；报道中的观景效果不等同于任何天气下均可实现。", "en": "The bridge and the “Silver Ingot Viewing Mountain” scenic corridor are treated as one viewing point; mountain views depend on weather and visibility.\nExisting sources focus on the scenic corridor and sightseeing routes and do not specify the bridge’s construction date, structural dimensions, protection status, or independent opening rules; the viewing effects described in reports do not mean they can be achieved under all weather conditions."}, "address": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "specialty": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "shop_kind": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "platform": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "photo": null, "objects": [], "review": null}, "37": {"seq": 37, "place": "desheng_bridge", "name": {"zh": "德胜桥", "en": "Desheng Bridge"}, "aliases": [], "tier": "B", "core": 6.069000000000001, "kind": "culture", "area": {"zh": "什刹海", "en": "Shichahai"}, "related": {"zh": "什刹海历史文化风景区", "en": "Shichahai Historic and Cultural Scenic Area"}, "dwell": null, "status": {"zh": "当前开放未核实；历史安排不作实时承诺", "en": "Current access is unverified; historical arrangements are not a live opening guarantee."}, "source": {"zh": "依据官方文旅及平台资料整理（AI整理），逐条出处见下方", "en": "AI summary of saved official tourism and platform sources; references below"}, "sources": [{"title": "北京市西城区人民政府", "url": "https://www.bjxch.gov.cn/xcfw/whfw/xxxq/pnidpv737672.html"}, {"title": "北京市西城区人民政府", "url": "https://www.bjxch.gov.cn/rwxc/xxxq/pnidpv954519.html"}], "borrowed": {"zh": "闸桥合一，与德胜门箭楼为不同对象；保留1919年桥面改造等历史信息，不当作当前通行状态。\n来源明确记载了历史改造，但没有提供桥体现状、当前通行管理或开放时间；线路文章仅将其列为游览节点。", "en": "The sluice and bridge are integrated and are a different object from the Deshengmen Barbican; historical information such as the 1919 bridge-deck renovation is retained and is not treated as the current traffic status.\nSources clearly record historical renovations but do not provide information on the bridge’s current condition, current traffic management, or opening hours; route articles merely list it as a sightseeing stop."}, "address": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "specialty": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "shop_kind": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "platform": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "photo": null, "objects": [], "review": null}, "38": {"seq": 38, "place": "wanning", "name": {"zh": "万宁桥（澄清上闸）", "en": "Wanning Bridge (Chengqing Upper Sluice Gate)"}, "aliases": [], "tier": "A", "core": 7.6, "kind": "culture", "area": {"zh": "什刹海", "en": "Shichahai"}, "related": {"zh": "什刹海历史文化风景区", "en": "Shichahai Historic and Cultural Scenic Area"}, "dwell": null, "status": {"zh": "当前开放未核实；历史安排不作实时承诺", "en": "Current access is unverified; historical arrangements are not a live opening guarantee."}, "source": {"zh": "依据官方文旅及平台资料整理（AI整理），逐条出处见下方", "en": "AI summary of saved official tourism and platform sources; references below"}, "sources": [{"title": "北京市文物局-万宁桥", "url": "https://wwj.beijing.gov.cn/bjww/362760/362767/2020nwhhzrycr/10812184/10815278/index.html"}, {"title": "玩转什刹海，风景区内这些地方可以逛", "url": "https://www.visitbeijing.com.cn/article/4NjY2r2DT0q?device=amp"}], "borrowed": {"zh": "桥与其水闸遗产关系保留，不把石桥现存构件笼统全称为元代原物。\n不同来源对始建及重修表述侧重点不同，均予保留；桥的历史沿革不等于现存全部构件均为元代原物。未据此推断当前开放或通行安排。", "en": "The relationship between the bridge and its sluice heritage is retained; the existing stone-bridge components are not broadly described as original Yuan dynasty objects.\nDifferent sources emphasize different aspects of the initial construction and renovations, all of which are retained; the bridge’s historical evolution does not mean that all existing components are original Yuan dynasty objects. No current opening or traffic arrangements are inferred from this."}, "address": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "specialty": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "shop_kind": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "platform": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "photo": null, "objects": [], "review": null}, "39": {"seq": 39, "place": "water_beasts", "name": 