ngements are not a live opening guarantee."}, "source": {"zh": "依据官方文旅及平台资料整理（AI整理），逐条出处见下方", "en": "AI summary of saved official tourism and platform sources; references below"}, "sources": [{"title": "玩转什刹海，风景区内这些地方可以逛", "url": "https://www.visitbeijing.com.cn/article/4NjY2r2DT0q?device=amp"}, {"title": "辛苦了老师 教师节这天 什刹海给老师留了一份秋色_信息提示_首都之窗_北京市人民政府门户网站", "url": "https://www.beijing.gov.cn/fuwu/bmfw/sy/jrts/202609/t20260910_4857944.html"}], "borrowed": {"zh": "历史市集与当代商业街区分别描述；不将旧文店铺名录当作当前营业承诺。\n历史市集沿革与当代商业定位分别来自同一官方旧文；资料未说明当前营业时间、店铺清单或实时经营状态。", "en": "The historical market and the contemporary commercial district are described separately; an old shop directory is not treated as a current promise that the shops are operating.\nThe market’s historical development and its contemporary commercial positioning come separately from the same old official article; the material does not specify current business hours, shop listings, or real-time operating status."}, "address": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "specialty": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "shop_kind": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "platform": {"zh": "", "en": ""}, "photo": null, "objects": [], "review": null}, "41": {"seq": 41, "place": "yandai", "name": {"zh": "烟袋斜街", "en": "Yandai Xiejie"}, "aliases": [], "tier": "B", "core": 6.443, "kind": "culture", "area": {"zh": "什刹海", "en": "Shichahai"}, "related": {"zh": "什刹海历史文化风景区", "en": "Shichahai Historic and Cultural Scenic Area"}, "dwell": null, "status": {"zh": "当前开放未核实；历史安排不作实时承诺", "en": "Current access is unverified; historical arrangements are not a live opening guarantee."}, "source": {"zh": "依据官方文旅及平台资料整理（AI整理），逐条出处见下方", "en": "AI summary of saved official tourism and platform sources; references below"}, "sources": [{"title": "玩转什刹海，风景区内这些地方可以逛", "url": "https://www.visitbeijing.com.cn/article/4NjY2r2DT0q?device=amp"}, {"title": "北京市西城区人民政府", "url": "https://www.bjxch.gov.cn/rwxc/xxxq/pnidpv954519.html"}], "borrowed": {"zh": "街道整体与广福观有包含关系，不把商店逐一当作文物景点。\n本条概述街道整体；商店仅作为街道商业文化的概括，不逐一列为景点